    "name": "Vitally REST Accounts Custom Objects API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Vitally's public REST API for creating, updating, retrieving and listing the core Customer Success objects — Accounts, Organizations, Users, Tasks, Notes, Conversations and NPS Responses. Authentication is HTTP Basic using a Vitally REST API key as the username. List endpoints use cursor-based pagination ordered by updatedAt (default) or createdAt.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Vitally",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
